Function Feasible_sample(UniqueId  ; theDistribution )
Title: Feasible Sample
Description: returns the feasible sample obtained from the larger sam~~
ple size.
Definition: if Give_Unique_ID then  uniqueID ~
else if use_feasible and isProb ~
then Slice(#feasible_Samples[Chance_Variables=uniqueId],~
                  Reduced_run_dim,Run)~
else theDistribution
